    "description": "# PL-6: Ban Automation\n\n_Automated fallout from banning a Player — flags open Sign Ups and Redeposits, holds unpaid Payouts and pending Referral payouts, and can raise a Fraud Flag._\n\n### AUTOMATION\n\n* Trigger: Player is banned (Player Status set to Banned)\n\n* Runs the actions below automatically.\n\n* Flags open Sign Ups for Ops review\n* Flags open Redeposits for Ops review\n* Places any unpaid Payouts on Hold\n* Places any pending Referral payouts tied to this player on Hold\n* Optionally creates a Fraud Flag record\n\n### IMPLEMENTATION REQUIREMENTS\n\n* Not walked through as a stand-alone item in the transcript\n\n* This list reflects the prototype's Ban modal impact summary only — no meeting quote confirms it directly.\n\n* Ban modal's reason picklist + required Notes capture is still an open question\n\n* Tied to PL-5's open question — whether the Ban modal still captures a typed Ban Reason and required Notes now that persistent Restriction Detail fields are cut. Confirm with Kobi/Joyce before building.\n\n### NOTES\n\n* Provenance: PL-6 (Player Record User Stories doc).\n* Direct quote from the prototype's Ban modal (not transcript-confirmed): \"Impact on this player right now: 2 open Sign Ups will be flagged for review · 1 Redeposit will be flagged · 1 unpaid payout of $180.00 CAD moves to Hold · \\[Referrer\\]'s pending referral payout of $40.00 CAD moves to Hold.\"\n* Depends on the Redeposit, Payout, and Referral objects existing — no Asana tickets for those yet.\n\n### SOURCE\n\n* [Taryn doc PL-6 — Player Record User Stories](https://docs.google.com/document/d/1OSqt7ilS1feVS7aVxAYSsBZIcTrc1J31_WnQiVucEJg/edit)\n* Dependencies: [BUILD-175 — Player: Ban Status + Banner](https://app.asana.com/1/1202721605677544/project/1215732799516730/task/1217686087320935)\n* Owner (proposed): Taryn Reithofer\n* Remember to update the requirements documentation as part of this change.\n* Created 2026-08-20 from Player record documentation review.\n\n",
